    "body": "Here is the output you requested...\r\n\r\n```\r\nstarship module java\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): STARSHIP_CONFIG is not set\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Using default config path: C:\\Users\\JUnderwo\\.config/starship.toml\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Config file content: \"\r\n# --- starship prompt config file ----------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n# --- performance issues -------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n# - if there are performance issues, remove the following line\r\n#   $git_status\\\r\n# - if performance issues have been addressed, the following line should appear after $git_state\r\n#   $git_status\\\r\n\r\n# --- prompt format ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n$username\\\r\n$hostname\\\r\n$shlvl\\\r\n$kubernetes\\\r\n$directory\\\r\n$git_branch\\\r\n$git_commit\\\r\n$git_state\\\r\n$hg_branch\\\r\n$docker_context\\\r\n$package\\\r\n$cmake\\\r\n$dart\\\r\n$dotnet\\\r\n$elixir\\\r\n$elm\\\r\n$erlang\\\r\n$golang\\\r\n$helm\\\r\n$java\\\r\n$julia\\\r\n$nim\\\r\n$nodejs\\\r\n$ocaml\\\r\n$perl\\\r\n$php\\\r\n$purescript\\\r\n$python\\\r\n$ruby\\\r\n$rust\\\r\n$swift\\\r\n$terraform\\\r\n$zig\\\r\n$nix_shell\\\r\n$conda\\\r\n$memory_usage\\\r\n$aws\\\r\n$gcloud\\\r\n$env_var\\\r\n$crystal\\\r\n$custom\\\r\n$cmd_duration\\\r\n$line_break\\\r\n$jobs\\\r\n$battery\\\r\n$time\\\r\n$status\\\r\n$character\"\"\"\r\n\r\n# --- prompt overrides and additions -------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n[java]\r\nsymbol = \" \"\r\nstyle = \"red\"\r\n\r\n[custom.grails]\r\ndescription = \"The version of Grails used in this project\"\r\ncommand = \"rg grailsVersion gradle.properties | cut -d'=' -f2\"\r\nfiles = [\"grailsw\", \"gradle.properties\"]\r\nsymbol = \" \"\r\nstyle = \"green\"\r\n\r\n[time]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n\"\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config parsed: Table({\"format\": String(\"$username$hostname$shlvl$kubernetes$directory$git_branch$git_commit$git_state$hg_branch$docker_context$package$cmake$dart$dotnet$elixir$elm$erlang$golang$helm$java$julia$nim$nodejs$ocaml$perl$php$purescript$python$ruby$rust$swift$terraform$zig$nix_shell$conda$memory_usage$aws$gcloud$env_var$crystal$custom$cmd_duration$line_break$jobs$battery$time$status$character\"), \"java\": Table({\"symbol\": String(\"\\u{e256} \"), \"style\": String(\"red\")}), \"custom\": Table({\"grails\": Table({\"description\": String(\"The version of Grails used in this project\"), \"command\": String(\"rg grailsVersion gradle.properties | cut -d\\'=\\' -f2\"), \"files\": Array([String(\"grailsw\"), String(\"gradle.properties\")]), \"symbol\": String(\"\\u{e7b3} \"), \"style\": String(\"green\")})}), \"time\": Table({\"disabled\": Boolean(false)})})\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::context): Building HashSets of directory files, folders and extensions took 1.2954ms\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config found for \"java\": Some(Table({\"symbol\": String(\"\\u{e256} \"), \"style\": String(\"red\")}))\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): Executing command \"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\AdoptOpenJDK\\\\jdk-11.0.10.9-hotspot\\\"/bin/java\" with args [\"-Xinternalversion\"]\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): Unable to find \"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\AdoptOpenJDK\\\\jdk-11.0.10.9-hotspot\\\"/bin/java\" in PATH, CannotFindBinaryPath\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Parsing color_string: red\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Read predefined color: red\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 35.1546ms to compute module \"java\"\r\nvia \r\n```\r\n\r\nIt appears that starship is looking for `/bin/java` in the JAVA_HOME. On Windows 10, perhaps it needs to look for `\\bin\\java.exe`? \r\n\r\nThanks for looking into this. Much appreciated!\r\n",
