    "body": "What is the value of your `$JAVA_HOME`? It looks like you have quotes in there which confuse starship. Is `JAVA_HOME` expected to be a shell-escaped path?\r\nIf you wish to avoid spaces in the path it looks like using `C:\\Progra~1` instead of `C:\\Program Files` is a common workaround.",
