    "body": "No problem, I think you are right. Looking at the code for the Java module we are just appending `/bin/java` to `$JAVA_HOME` what we should probably be doing is converting `$JAVA_HOME` into a [path](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/path/struct.Path.html) and then join `bin` and `java` to make sure we use the correct separators. This is just a theory, I haven't actually verified this is the case. ",
