    "body": "It looks like your `JAVA_HOME` has imbalanced quotes `C:\\Program Files\\AdoptOpenJDK\\jdk-11.0.10.9-hotspot\"`\r\n\r\nI did some research and `JAVA_HOME` is likely not supposed to be quoted/shell-esacpe and quoting makes some programs work and breaks others. You're likely better off avoiding spaces and setting `JAVA_HOME` to `C:\\Progra~1\\AdoptOpenJDK\\jdk-11.0.10.9-hotspot`",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
